    summary_60s: 'Crops are plants that farmers grow and harvest for food, sale, or other uses. Examples include maize, rice, yam, vegetables, and fruits. Crops can also be grown for materials (like cotton) or animal feed. Classification of Crops Based on Uses Crops can be classified based on thei',
